summary.label:
Have you ever felt out of space in your DnD or RPG campaign table? Now, with you can level up your game and roll all of your dice on your Apple Watch. Dungeons and Dice will be your new dice tray, to carry with you no matter where you go!

In Dungeons and dice you'll find:
* 6 dice to choose from (d4, d6, d8, d10, d12, d20);
* Easy rolls with 1 simple tap;
* Intuitive design made especially for Apple Watch;
* Animation and sound effects;
* Lightweight;
